---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { site } from "../data/site";
---

<BaseLayout title="关于" description={`关于 ${site.name}。`}>
  <section class="about-page">
    <header>
      <p>ABOUT / 关于</p>
      <h1>你好，<br />我是 Ryan。</h1>
    </header>
    <div class="about-copy">
      <p class="lead">{site.bio}</p>
      <p>这个网站是我的数字花园：用来沉淀阶段性的想法、项目复盘和学习笔记。内容会慢慢生长，不追求日更，只记录值得留下来的东西。</p>
      <div class="contact-block">
        <p>找到我</p>
        <div>
          {site.links.map((link) => <a href={link.href} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">{link.label} ↗</a>)}
          <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>Email ↗</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
